{"d":14,"passage":{"title":"白鲸","author":"Herman Melville","text":"The hours wore on;—Ahab now shut up within his cabin; anon, pacing the deck, with the same intense bigotry of purpose in his aspect. Suddenly he came to a halt by the bulwarks, and inserting his bone leg into the auger-hole there, and with one hand grasping a shroud, he ordered Starbuck to send everybody aft. But, they were all eagerness again, as Ahab, now half-revolving in his pivot-hole, with one hand reaching high up a shroud, and tightly, almost convulsively grasping it, addressed them thus:— Skin your eyes for him, men; look sharp for white water; if ye see but a bubble, sing out.\" Aye, aye,\" he shouted with a terrific, loud, animal sob, like that of a heart-stricken moose; \"Aye, aye! How many barrels will thy vengeance yield thee even if thou gettest it, Captain Ahab? But in each event—in the living act, the undoubted deed—there, some unknown but still reasoning thing puts forth the mouldings of its features from behind the unreasoning mask."},"words":[{"w":"peripherals","uk":"pə'rɪfərəls","us":"/pə'rɪfərəls/","p":"","m":"n. （计算机的）外围设备, 周边设备( peripheral的复数形式 )","f":[],"c":[],"o":null,"q":null,"b":null},{"w":"bestsellers","uk":"","us":"","p":"","m":"(bestseller 的复数) n. 畅销书","f":[],"c":[],"o":null,"q":null,"b":null},{"w":"eminem","uk":"'æminem","us":"/'æminem/","p":"","m":"n. 艾米纳姆（上个世纪末涌现出的白人rap音乐代表）","f":[],"c":[],"o":null,"q":null,"b":null},{"w":"minneapolis","uk":",mini'æpəlis","us":"/,mini'æpəlis/","p":"","m":"[经] 明尼亚波利","f":[],"c":[],"o":null,"q":null,"b":null},{"w":"bikini","uk":"bi'kiːni","us":"/bi'kiːni/","p":"","m":"n. 大爆炸, 比基尼泳装","f":[],"c":[],"o":null,"q":null,"b":null},{"w":"memphis","uk":"'memfis","us":"/'memfis/","p":"","m":"n. 孟菲斯","f":[],"c":[],"o":null,"q":null,"b":{"r":"Hosea 9:5","c":"何西阿书 9:5","t":"What will ye do in the solemn day, and in the day of the feast of the LORD? 9:6 For, lo, they are gone because of destruction: Egypt shall gather them up, Memphis shall bury the